          <li><strong>35+ mid-to-bottom-funnel content pieces</strong>: tutorials, integration guides, developer case studies.</li>
          <li>Bootstrapped Sygma Discord to <strong>500+ members</strong>; grew Telegram community <strong>700%</strong>.</li>
