    <div class="container cta-inner">
      <div class="section-label">Get in touch</div>
      <h2>Let's talk.</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">
        Open to DevRel, BD, content strategy, and AI systems roles — full-time, contract, or advisory. Best reach is Telegram <a href="https://t.me/haochizzle" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@haochizzle</a> or email <a href="mailto:tim@tim-hch.com">tim@tim-hch.com</a>.
      </p>
      <div class="contact-row">
        <a href="mailto:tim@tim-hch.com" class="btn btn-primary">Email me</a>
